    {"speaker":"双沢 美空","text":"わたし、サマーアクティビティが好きだから、外で遊ぶの大好きなんです。キャンプもきっと楽しいだろうなぁって。","storySprites":[{"id":"ah","src":"images/assets/char/ah_misora/standing/ah_misora_expression_03_smile.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1}]},
    {"speaker":"双沢 美空","text":"店長と須藤さんがいつもどんな感じでキャンプしてるのかも、ちょっと見てみたいです。","storySprites":[{"id":"ah","src":"images/assets/char/ah_misora/standing/ah_misora_expression_12_proud.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1}]},
