    {"speaker":"双沢 美空","text":"須藤さん、これからも店長と仲良くしてあげてくださいね。"},
    {"speaker":"双沢 美空","text":"いつも店長と遊んでくれて、ありがとうございます。🩷","storySprites":[{"id":"ah","src":"images/assets/char/ah_misora/standing/ah_misora_expression_02_gentle_smile.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1}]},
    {"speaker":"双沢 美空","text":"今度はぜひ、美空も一緒に！","storySprites":[{"id":"ah","src":"images/assets/char/ah_misora/standing/ah_misora_expression_11_expectation.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1}]},
    {"speaker":"双沢 美空","text":"そのときは、よろしくお願いします！"},
    {"speaker":"","text":"少し考えてから、美空はぺこっと頭を下げる。","storySprites":[{"id":"ah","src":"images/assets/char/ah_misora/standing/ah_misora_expression_01_composed.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1}]},
